        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">Other changes reported in 2025 consist primarily of gains and losses on the disposal of assets or inadvertent charges made to accumulated depreciation/ amortization that were written off.</span>
